oydras, and is squeezed in between a Subway and Taco del Mar. Convenience is key here and their central location Downtown makes it the prime reason I frequent this Smoothie King in particular. It's within comfortable walking distance to Tulane, City Hall, Benson Tower, the Superdome, etc. so if you're doing business in that vicinity then this is definitely the most convenient location. I haven't had any real issues with this location, and overall I am happy with the service I've recieved here. I park in the SP+/HEAL garage located across the street diagonally, so parking has never been an issue in my..."},{"business_id":"5W4qgffwg3bWynEV2Y8Z_A","review_id":"hRYGLrxE_nKOZdCHdaVWUA","date":"2018-06-30T02:40:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9417046308517456,"text_excerpt":"Good smoothie king! Nothing super special but very well clean building and good service. Close to the hotels downtown and the taste of the smoothies was great. Can't beat it"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
